    "body": "It looks like the initial serial device enumeration pass is taking a long time. Once this completes Chrome has a cache of known devices so later queries are fast. Given conditions (2) and (4) it sounds like the enumeration task is getting stuck behind a higher-priority task.\r\n\r\nI've filed [a Chromium issue](https://crbug.com/362659159) for this so that the team owning the implementation in Chromium can track it. This issue tracker is for the specification, not any particular implementation.",
